      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'll also note, I suspect this can be addressed using the imposter settings component, and if so I could put that into the modular avatar implementation, but that'll take a while for people to adopt and reupload things, so it's probably better to handle on the impostorization side... (you can implement this kind of thing without MA as well after all)",
