      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5c1475afb7ce126e9e0e3a39|full_name} I took a look at this particular avatar and I think it might need a VRCImpostorSettings script to reparent those \"first-person\" hair strands to the Head bone. As it stands, they're a child of the neck bone, which the impostor generator will group with the chest. \n\nAdding a VRCImpostorSettings script to the Head bone, and then adding the first-person hair bone into its \"Reparent Here\" list should do the trick I think.\n\nWe do our best to make the impostorizer as compatible as we can with the widest variety of avatars, but sometimes it still needs a little nudge!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
